  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nordpraktik &#xe4;r ett utbildningsprogram f&#xf6;r 20 utvalda unga entrepren&#xf6;rer fr&#xe5;n de baltiska l&#xe4;nderna. Programmet utg&#xf6;rs av praktik p&#xe5; svenska f&#xf6;retag. I samband med praktiken finansierar Sida en f&#xf6;rberedelsekurs f&#xf6;r deltagarna f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5; en god introduktion och f&#xf6;r att kunna tillgodog&#xf6;ra sig praktiken b&#xe4;ttre.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is reserved for an educational programme during the stay of 20 young trainees from the Baltic States at Swedish  enterprises. The educational prgramme is held within project Nord- praktik, administred by the Nordic Association. The traniees will attend courses in management, political science as an introduction.</narrative>
  </description>
